# Public data host for the embedded Vice City game.
#
# These are public URLs with no secrets, so the file is versioned on purpose:
# it is the single source for the local production build and for a Netlify git
# build. The data itself is never committed (see ADR-013/ADR-014/ADR-015).
#
# Host: a Cloudflare Worker in front of the private R2 bucket (ADR-015). It
# replaced the `r2.dev` URL, which Cloudflare marks as rate-limited and unfit for
# production and which cannot set cache/CORS headers. Paths are unchanged:
# `build/` carries the engine (`reVC.js|.wasm|.data`), `manifest.json` the index,
# `trailers/vc.mp4` the intro video and `vc-streamed.tar.gz` the whole data.
VITE_VC_BUILD_URL=https://vicecity-data.carv-portfolio.workers.dev/build/
VITE_VC_STREAMED_URL=https://vicecity-data.carv-portfolio.workers.dev/streamed/
VITE_VC_MANIFEST_URL=https://vicecity-data.carv-portfolio.workers.dev/manifest.json
VITE_VC_TRAILER_URL=https://vicecity-data.carv-portfolio.workers.dev/trailers/vc.mp4
# Whole game data in one tar.gz (1.045 MB of files, 815 MB gzipped): the game
# asks the host ONE time instead of 17.399. If the file is missing, the loader
# falls back to walking the manifest file by file.
VITE_VC_ARCHIVE_URL=https://vicecity-data.carv-portfolio.workers.dev/vc-streamed.tar.gz
